# Optional Bitrise sketch (not live)

This repository runs CI on **GitHub Actions** + local `./bin/ci.sh`. The workflow
below is an **equivalent** sketch only — it is not connected to a Bitrise app.

```yaml
# bitrise.yml.example — DO NOT treat as active CI
format_version: "11"
default_step_lib_source: https://github.com/bitrise-io/bitrise-steplib.git

workflows:
  primary:
    steps:
      - script:
          title: Lint
          inputs:
            - content: |-
                #!/usr/bin/env bash
                set -euo pipefail
                ./bin/lint.sh
      - script:
          title: iPhone test lane
          inputs:
            - content: |-
                #!/usr/bin/env bash
                set -euo pipefail
                ./bin/ci-iphone-test.sh
      - script:
          title: Platform builds
          inputs:
            - content: |-
                #!/usr/bin/env bash
                set -euo pipefail
                ./bin/ci-platform-builds.sh
```

Prefer documenting parity in [`docs/ci-cd-map.md`](docs/ci-cd-map.md) over
standing up a second CI host for the portfolio demo.
